WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.666 --> 00:00:10.233
Pika pika pikachu!

2
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.933
Hey, look, Squishy, we're here.

3
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:23.000
As our heroes continue toward Snowbelle City,

4
00:00:23.066 --> 00:00:25.800
they now take a detour to see Terminus Cave

5
00:00:26.266 --> 00:00:29.500
thanks to a recommendation from Sawyer and Squishy.

6
00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:32.966
Why are they going in there?

7
00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.600
Twerp-ish curiosity?

8
00:00:36.366 --> 00:00:39.333
Wherever Pikachu goes, Team Rocket goes, too.

9
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.800
- Like right now!
- And how.

10
00:00:41.866 --> 00:00:44.266
Wow!

11
00:00:45.533 --> 00:00:47.966
I heard this mine was abandoned years ago.

12
00:00:48.033 --> 00:00:51.933
But now it's home to wild Pokémon, so, it attracts lots of trainers.

13
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:53.800
Look, an Ariados.

14
00:00:54.966 --> 00:00:56.300
There's a Shuckle.

15
00:00:56.366 --> 00:00:57.900
Shuckle.

16
00:00:57.966 --> 00:00:59.266
And a Lairon, too.

17
00:00:59.800 --> 00:01:01.500
It's just like Sawyer said.

18
00:01:04.433 --> 00:01:05.900
- Huh?
- Pika?

19
00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.433
- Squishy?
- Bonnie?

20
00:01:18.366 --> 00:01:21.600
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

21
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:25.233
♪ Knock me down, I'll just get up again ♪

22
00:01:26.166 --> 00:01:29.300
♪ You've met your match Yeah, I'm no beginner ♪

23
00:01:29.366 --> 00:01:32.366
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

24
00:01:32.566 --> 00:01:33.533
♪ Gotta catch 'em all!

25
00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:36.933
♪ I stand tall 'cause I know I'm a winner ♪

26
00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:40.033
♪ Pokémon, Pokémon ♪

27
00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.566
♪ Gotta catch 'em all! ♪

28
00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:55.966
Squishy, wait.

29
00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.966
Pika pika!

30
00:02:01.266 --> 00:02:03.333
Hey, Squishy, are you looking for something?

31
00:02:05.766 --> 00:02:07.333
Is that what it's doing?

32
00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:10.466
Oh, yeah. Braixen, come out.

33
00:02:13.566 --> 00:02:15.700
Light up that area with your flame.

34
00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:21.266
- Thanks!
- I can see great now.

35
00:02:21.333 --> 00:02:23.566
Hey, I can help light things up, too.

36
00:02:23.933 --> 00:02:25.433
Clemontic Gear, on.

37
00:02:47.966 --> 00:02:50.233
Couldn't we take an easier path, Squishy?

38
00:02:58.033 --> 00:03:00.833
- We've come really far.
- Yeah.

39
00:03:04.766 --> 00:03:07.633
- How much farther is it?
- Hey, Squishy.

40
00:03:19.533 --> 00:03:22.766
- Squishy, wait!
- Bonnie, it's dangerous.

41
00:03:22.833 --> 00:03:25.833
- Squishy's going without us.
- Calm down.

42
00:03:27.033 --> 00:03:28.066
Pika!

43
00:03:28.633 --> 00:03:30.833
There's no way we can go down there.

44
00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:34.300
But Squishy can't go alone. We've gotta catch up!

45
00:03:34.366 --> 00:03:36.333
Hey, don't worry about it, Bonnie.

46
00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.566
I know exactly what we can do to go after it, okay?

47
00:03:40.300 --> 00:03:41.833
Noibat, I choose you.

48
00:03:43.300 --> 00:03:44.466
Noibat.

49
00:03:44.933 --> 00:03:48.733
Use your ultrasonic waves to find us an easy way to get down there from here.

50
00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:49.966
Yes, please.

51
00:03:55.433 --> 00:03:57.100
Luxray, help us out, too.

52
00:03:59.033 --> 00:04:00.133
Luxray!

53
00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.833
Use your amazing eyesight to help Noibat look around as well.

54
00:04:03.900 --> 00:04:05.333
Good thinking, Clemont.

55
00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.833
Ray ray.

56
00:04:11.666 --> 00:04:13.366
- Noibat.
- Luxray.

57
00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:16.266
- This way?
- Thanks, both of you.

58
00:04:17.033 --> 00:04:18.700
- Ray.
- Noibat.

59
00:04:18.766 --> 00:04:21.133
- Okay, let's go find Squishy.
- Right!

60
00:04:29.966 --> 00:04:33.733
- How far are they gonna go?
- They're tougher than twerps should be.

61
00:04:33.800 --> 00:04:36.866
- Yeah, well, we're even tougher.
- I wonder what lies ahead.

62
00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:41.066
- Treasure? Intrigue?
- Neither one. Pikachu!

63
00:05:09.766 --> 00:05:12.966
- It's here.
- I'm glad we kept it under surveillance.

64
00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:15.433
- Hey, it's Z1.
- What?

65
00:05:17.033 --> 00:05:18.300
Come in. Come in.

66
00:05:18.766 --> 00:05:21.033
Z1 has appeared in Terminus Cave.

67
00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.133
Ray!

68
00:05:44.733 --> 00:05:46.000
Huh? Luxray?

69
00:05:46.766 --> 00:05:49.033
- Wow, so, you found Squishy.
- Come on.

70
00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:50.133
Pika!

71
00:05:52.966 --> 00:05:55.966
Report. Are you well?

72
00:06:04.633 --> 00:06:06.100
I am well.

73
00:06:08.033 --> 00:06:10.433
We've detected a strong wave from Z1.

74
00:06:11.000 --> 00:06:12.933
Now Z2 is responding.

75
00:06:13.533 --> 00:06:17.433
We've picked up Z2's position. Mable, Aliana, let's go.

76
00:06:18.766 --> 00:06:19.933
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

77
00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:21.566
It may be the stuff of legends,

78
00:06:21.633 --> 00:06:24.766
but it's really quite foolish. I mean, it gave up its own location.

79
00:06:24.833 --> 00:06:28.666
It appears our detection system is simply too advanced for it.

80
00:06:32.366 --> 00:06:33.600
I will be fine.

81
00:06:33.666 --> 00:06:36.700
It is imperative that you flee from there at once.

82
00:06:36.766 --> 00:06:39.866
Lux! Luxray ray!

83
00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:44.800
Squishy.

84
00:06:44.866 --> 00:06:46.333
Pikachu!

85
00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.366
Thank goodness.

86
00:06:49.066 --> 00:06:51.566
Squishy, don't go off alone like that.

87
00:06:51.633 --> 00:06:53.100
We were so worried.

88
00:06:57.166 --> 00:06:59.066
Huh?

89
00:06:59.133 --> 00:07:01.766
- Squishy, where are you?
- Squishy.

90
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:05.900
What's this all about?

91
00:07:05.966 --> 00:07:10.133
- Mysteries by the score.
- And what's the deal with that Squishy?

92
00:07:18.166 --> 00:07:19.833
- On location now.
- Roger.

93
00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:21.266
- Hey.
- Huh?

94
00:07:21.333 --> 00:07:23.033
I'm afraid you're late.

95
00:07:23.566 --> 00:07:24.833
Got stuck in traffic.

96
00:07:25.466 --> 00:07:26.500
Mm-hm.

97
00:07:27.466 --> 00:07:29.500
I had wondered if you had had an accident.

98
00:07:29.966 --> 00:07:31.400
Whatever, Celosia. Hurry.

99
00:07:31.466 --> 00:07:34.500
- Z1's waiting for us.
- Okay, okay. Let's go.

100
00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:45.766
Squishy, where are you?

101
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:47.666
- Squishy?
- Pika?

102
00:07:47.733 --> 00:07:50.100
Squishy, come out.

103
00:07:50.800 --> 00:07:52.033
Any luck, Luxray?

104
00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:53.633
Luxray.

105
00:07:54.466 --> 00:07:55.500
Anything, Noibat?

106
00:07:56.033 --> 00:07:58.733
Noi-noi-noi-noibat. Bat-bat-bat. Noi.

107
00:07:58.800 --> 00:07:59.633
No good.

108
00:08:00.800 --> 00:08:02.933
Maybe Squishy's not here anymore.

109
00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:04.400
No way.

110
00:08:04.466 --> 00:08:06.466
Stop. I know it's here.

111
00:08:07.066 --> 00:08:08.066
Huh?

112
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:11.333
You're right.

113
00:08:13.533 --> 00:08:15.300
You're here, Squishy, right?

114
00:08:15.366 --> 00:08:16.266
Come on out.

115
00:08:16.533 --> 00:08:17.800
Please, Squishy.

116
00:08:17.866 --> 00:08:19.266
Where are you?

117
00:08:32.766 --> 00:08:35.100
All right, you kids. Don't move.

118
00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.566
Pika pika!

119
00:08:36.633 --> 00:08:38.033
It's you guys again.

120
00:08:39.233 --> 00:08:41.533
- Oh! They're here.
- The people with the eyewear.

121
00:08:41.600 --> 00:08:43.799
Pika--

122
00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.833
That was a warning.

123
00:08:51.900 --> 00:08:53.633
The next will be much worse.

124
00:09:12.266 --> 00:09:13.100
Found you.

125
00:09:19.833 --> 00:09:21.500
- Huh?
- What was that?

126
00:09:21.566 --> 00:09:23.066
Looks like I missed.

127
00:09:28.066 --> 00:09:31.233
- What in the world are they shooting at?
- They must see something.

128
00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:32.466
What they see is Squishy.

129
00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.300
Pika pika!

130
00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:38.933
Pika pika!

131
00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.500
- Something's in there.
- Squishy's in there.

132
00:09:55.066 --> 00:09:56.733
Oh, no, Squishy.

133
00:09:58.066 --> 00:10:00.033
Who's that Pokémon?

134
00:10:05.066 --> 00:10:06.933
It's Drapion.

135
00:10:13.066 --> 00:10:14.033
Squishy.

136
00:10:14.100 --> 00:10:15.500
Look out.

137
00:10:18.333 --> 00:10:20.000
I told you not to move.

138
00:10:20.066 --> 00:10:21.333
Let's go, everybody.

139
00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:23.566
- Now, Luxray.
- Braixen, ready?

140
00:10:25.200 --> 00:10:26.100
Houndour, go.

141
00:10:31.266 --> 00:10:33.233
Noibat, supersonic.

142
00:10:36.433 --> 00:10:37.466
Now, tackle.

143
00:10:38.100 --> 00:10:39.133
Noibat!

144
00:10:39.633 --> 00:10:40.466
Drapion.

145
00:10:40.533 --> 00:10:41.500
All right.

146
00:10:41.566 --> 00:10:43.100
Iron Head, go!

147
00:10:43.500 --> 00:10:44.900
Bisharp!

148
00:10:47.533 --> 00:10:49.066
Hey, are you okay, Noibat?

149
00:10:49.666 --> 00:10:51.566
Bisharp, Metal Sound.

150
00:10:51.633 --> 00:10:54.200
Bisharp!

151
00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:56.533
- Catch it.
- All right.

152
00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:57.800
Huh?

153
00:11:06.133 --> 00:11:07.800
- Not you.
- Hmm?

154
00:11:08.266 --> 00:11:10.133
Talk about twerp denial.

155
00:11:10.466 --> 00:11:11.833
Trouble? Double.

156
00:11:12.033 --> 00:11:13.266
Make it worthwhile.

157
00:11:13.633 --> 00:11:15.833
To protect Squishy from confiscation.

158
00:11:15.900 --> 00:11:18.166
To transfer it over within our nation.

159
00:11:18.266 --> 00:11:20.666
To denounce the evils of tacky goggles.

160
00:11:20.733 --> 00:11:22.700
To watch this circus, the mind boggles.

161
00:11:22.766 --> 00:11:23.800
Jesse.

162
00:11:24.266 --> 00:11:25.300
And it's James.

163
00:11:25.366 --> 00:11:28.800
Team Rocket blasts off doing the thing that we do best.

164
00:11:29.266 --> 00:11:30.100
Surrender now.

165
00:11:30.333 --> 00:11:32.533
Give your amateur antics a rest.

166
00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:34.133
Meowth, with zest.

167
00:11:34.533 --> 00:11:37.533
Wobbuffet!

168
00:11:41.633 --> 00:11:43.800
So?

169
00:11:43.866 --> 00:11:46.133
So, we want that thing you call Z!

170
00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.333
Stop insulting our intelligence!

171
00:11:50.233 --> 00:11:54.433
- Any idea what they're talking about?
- Not a clue, but they sure are annoying.

172
00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:55.766
Bisharp!

173
00:11:57.166 --> 00:11:58.700
Greninja, let's go.

174
00:11:58.766 --> 00:12:00.633
Greninja!

175
00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:02.266
Get Squishy out of there.

176
00:12:04.966 --> 00:12:06.333
No!

177
00:12:08.766 --> 00:12:10.533
No fair! We took it first.

178
00:12:10.600 --> 00:12:12.233
Cross Poison, let's go.

179
00:12:16.733 --> 00:12:18.366
Use Stone Edge.

180
00:12:18.433 --> 00:12:19.833
Bisharp!

181
00:12:23.900 --> 00:12:25.266
Help out, Pikachu.

182
00:12:25.433 --> 00:12:26.666
Use Thunderbolt.

183
00:12:26.733 --> 00:12:28.200
Pikachu!

184
00:12:28.666 --> 00:12:30.000
Flamethrower, now!

185
00:12:31.766 --> 00:12:33.200
Luxray, use Swift.

186
00:12:33.733 --> 00:12:36.300
Luxray ray!

187
00:12:36.366 --> 00:12:37.833
All right, Dark Pulse.

188
00:12:54.133 --> 00:12:56.766
- Wow, Greninja, thank you.
- Awesome job.

189
00:12:57.233 --> 00:12:59.266
Are you all right, Squishy?

190
00:13:03.166 --> 00:13:06.500
Listen, that Squishy is more than it seems.

191
00:13:06.566 --> 00:13:08.366
It's our duty to retrieve it.

192
00:13:08.833 --> 00:13:10.100
Celosia, enough.

193
00:13:10.566 --> 00:13:15.300
Thank you for filling us in. If Squishy's more than meets the eye, what is it?

194
00:13:15.366 --> 00:13:18.600
A slip of the lip is no reason to think we're as dumb as you are.

195
00:13:18.666 --> 00:13:19.933
Drapion, Sludge Bomb.

196
00:13:31.433 --> 00:13:33.066
Now will you hand it over?

197
00:13:33.633 --> 00:13:35.700
- Ninja!
- Pika!

198
00:13:36.166 --> 00:13:37.500
I protect Squishy.

199
00:13:37.633 --> 00:13:39.733
I promised I'd never let it go.

200
00:13:41.566 --> 00:13:43.833
- You leave us no choice.
- Right.

201
00:13:46.933 --> 00:13:47.966
Huh?

202
00:13:48.633 --> 00:13:49.466
What?

203
00:13:50.533 --> 00:13:52.166
- Huh?
- Pika?

204
00:13:55.733 --> 00:13:56.933
Huh?

205
00:13:57.966 --> 00:13:59.833
Huh? Aah!

206
00:14:00.366 --> 00:14:01.733
- The cells.
- So many.

207
00:14:02.866 --> 00:14:05.366
- Cells?
- Are they Squishy's friends?

208
00:14:05.433 --> 00:14:06.466
Huh?

209
00:14:10.200 --> 00:14:12.066
Huh?

210
00:14:31.033 --> 00:14:32.000
That's Squishy?

211
00:14:32.266 --> 00:14:33.366
They all merged.

212
00:14:33.833 --> 00:14:36.100
Maybe this is some kind of evolution.

213
00:14:37.166 --> 00:14:39.366
- This is what you saw, right?
- Right.

214
00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.666
Squishy had that much power? Whoa.

215
00:15:03.066 --> 00:15:04.666
Bisharp!

216
00:15:24.233 --> 00:15:25.300
Squishy.

217
00:15:28.233 --> 00:15:29.266
- Oh.
- Pika?

218
00:15:32.866 --> 00:15:34.533
Liepard, after it.

219
00:15:36.800 --> 00:15:38.366
Manectric, go.

220
00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:43.666
Now, Pikachu and Greninja, stop them.

221
00:15:43.733 --> 00:15:46.766
Pikachu! Pika, pika.

222
00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:58.500
Quick, Liepard, Shadow Claw.

223
00:16:01.566 --> 00:16:03.033
Use Cut.

224
00:16:11.000 --> 00:16:12.233
Thunderbolt, go!

225
00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:20.633
Use Iron Tail.

226
00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.933
Pika pika!

227
00:16:28.000 --> 00:16:29.733
Hey, are you okay, Greninja?

228
00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.233
And that's that for Greninja.

229
00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:33.766
Hey, Ash.

230
00:16:36.433 --> 00:16:37.666
What a nuisance.

231
00:16:38.466 --> 00:16:39.366
Look.

232
00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:42.966
- Get out of the way, now.
- Greninja, can you still battle?

233
00:16:43.033 --> 00:16:45.300
Greninja.

234
00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:47.733
Let's go!

235
00:16:58.633 --> 00:16:59.633
Water Shuriken.

236
00:17:02.100 --> 00:17:03.200
Shock Wave.

237
00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.966
Go after it.

238
00:17:20.400 --> 00:17:21.800
Cut, let's go!

239
00:17:27.833 --> 00:17:29.133
Shadow Claw, now.

240
00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:31.333
Now use Aerial Ace.

241
00:17:38.066 --> 00:17:39.933
Greninja!

242
00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.533
- We cannot keep this up.
- You're right.

243
00:17:50.733 --> 00:17:52.966
Manectric, use Flash.

244
00:17:53.033 --> 00:17:55.466
Manectric!

245
00:17:55.533 --> 00:17:58.000
We need to get back to the drawing board.

246
00:17:58.733 --> 00:17:59.566
Right.

247
00:18:04.066 --> 00:18:05.100
Huh?

248
00:18:21.133 --> 00:18:22.766
Ash, are you okay?

249
00:18:22.833 --> 00:18:23.700
Yeah.
What happened?

250
00:18:24.933 --> 00:18:27.333
The same thing that happened back at Ninja Village.

251
00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:30.733
It was like I became a part of Greninja.

252
00:18:31.233 --> 00:18:32.300
- Became it?
- Yeah.

253
00:18:32.766 --> 00:18:35.266
Wait, I wanna know where Squishy went.

254
00:18:36.233 --> 00:18:38.933
Unfortunately, Z1 has not yet been located.

255
00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:41.633
Understood. So, keep your current location.

256
00:18:42.266 --> 00:18:44.133
I can't believe it got away.

257
00:18:44.266 --> 00:18:46.566
Yes. But it may still be close by.

258
00:18:47.333 --> 00:18:48.766
- Hmm?
- Huh?

259
00:18:49.833 --> 00:18:52.400
Those trainers seem to have a relationship with Z1.

260
00:18:52.800 --> 00:18:54.566
Perhaps we should keep an eye on them.

261
00:18:54.633 --> 00:18:56.100
I think that's a good idea.

262
00:18:56.166 --> 00:18:57.266
- Hey!
- Huh?

263
00:18:58.166 --> 00:19:00.333
What? Not you again.

264
00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:03.433
Those troublesome twerps are our concern.

265
00:19:03.500 --> 00:19:05.966
You get in our way, and you'll feel the burn.

266
00:19:06.266 --> 00:19:11.500
So, I don't know what you're planning, but we'll tell you once and only once.

267
00:19:11.566 --> 00:19:13.566
This world belongs to Giovanni.

268
00:19:13.633 --> 00:19:15.800
And that includes Team Rocket.

269
00:19:21.900 --> 00:19:22.833
What a joke.

270
00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:24.766
Totally.

271
00:19:25.566 --> 00:19:26.733
Squishy?

272
00:19:27.166 --> 00:19:28.733
Hey, Squishy.

273
00:19:28.933 --> 00:19:30.266
Come on out.

274
00:19:30.333 --> 00:19:31.500
Squishy.

275
00:19:31.566 --> 00:19:33.266
Pikachu?

276
00:19:33.333 --> 00:19:34.233
Not here.

277
00:19:34.700 --> 00:19:38.566
If Squishy got away from them, it's probably hiding around here.

278
00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:41.500
Maybe it doesn't wanna cause us any more trouble.

279
00:19:41.966 --> 00:19:42.933
No way.

280
00:19:43.566 --> 00:19:44.900
Huh?

281
00:19:44.966 --> 00:19:47.200
Squishy protected us, right?

282
00:19:48.566 --> 00:19:50.733
Remember, Squishy's our friend.

283
00:19:50.833 --> 00:19:53.233
I'm sure it's waiting for us somewhere.

284
00:19:54.466 --> 00:19:55.633
Yeah, you're right.

285
00:19:56.266 --> 00:19:57.966
I'm sure it's waiting, too.

286
00:19:58.700 --> 00:20:00.266
Pika, pika.

287
00:20:02.233 --> 00:20:03.600
Noibat bat. Noi.

288
00:20:03.666 --> 00:20:04.500
Yeah.

289
00:20:05.366 --> 00:20:06.900
We'll find you, Squishy.

290
00:20:07.533 --> 00:20:11.933
Our heroes are being confronted with many mysteries, one after the other.

291
00:20:12.233 --> 00:20:14.600
Why did Squishy run away from Bonnie?

292
00:20:14.766 --> 00:20:17.266
And what exactly is Squishy all about?

293
00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:20.800
The answers, as the journey continues.

294
00:20:23.166 --> 00:20:25.233
We've finally got clear footage

295
00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.933
of what Z1 looks like merged with its cells.

296
00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.666
It appears to be better able to move.

297
00:20:30.733 --> 00:20:32.966
It will require much more study.

298
00:20:33.633 --> 00:20:36.466
I feel we have yet to see the true power of Z.

299
00:20:37.266 --> 00:20:38.500
What about Z2?

300
00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:43.433
We're in the process of searching. But it's only just a matter of time.
